                    near you.
                </p>
                <button class="text-[#48AE4D] font-semibold">
                    Browse nurseries →
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="relative z-10 px-8 pb-28">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-12">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-5xl font-[Abril_Fatface] mb-3">
                    Comunidad
                </h2>
                <p class="text-[#636863]">
                    Share your plants and gardens.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">


            <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/40
                  rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
                <img src="resources/images/homepagee/escaneo-4.jpg" class="w-full h-72 object-cover">
                <div class="p-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                        <img src="resources/img/phot.jpg" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full">

                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-semibold">Carlos Méndez</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-[#636863]">
                                Tropical garden
                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <p class="text-[#636863] mb-5">
                        “My garden has finally come into bloom after weeks.”
                    </p>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-sm text-[#636863]">
                        <span>❤️ 120</span>
                        <span>💬 18</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/40
